<http://data.silknow.org/object/db498d5b-1389-374d-b5c8-799631db2018/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Rectangular piece, made of two fragments. On a natural ground, a virtually symmetrical design showing in center a fluted column interrupted at frequent intervals by heavily elaborated Ionic capitals carrying bunches of fruit and flowers. On each side, flanking column, a row of baskets carrying fruit and flowers. Shades of brown, blue and red. Faded; several holes and tears, one mended. Partial selvedges on both sides."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/db498d5b-1389-374d-b5c8-799631db2018> .

